// The three endings. Each is its own place, with something to do in it, and
// each is built around one image: two hands meeting over a painted sea of
// cloud; a marble colonnade of every Rin there ever was; a night lake filling
// with lanterns. Music is tied to what the player does: footsteps play notes.
